我用 Supabase Edge Function（Deno）做 LINE Bot 的 webhook，部署指令是 `supabase functions deploy line-webhook`。在 LINE Developers Console 按 Verify 一直出現 401 Unauthorized，用手機傳訊息給 bot 也完全沒反應。程式碼如下，幫我找出所有問題並給我改好的完整版本：

```ts
// supabase/functions/line-webhook/index.ts
import { createHmac } from "node:crypto";

const CHANNEL_SECRET = Deno.env.get("LINE_CHANNEL_SECRET")!;
const CHANNEL_TOKEN = Deno.env.get("LINE_CHANNEL_ACCESS_TOKEN")!;

Deno.serve(async (req) => {
  const body = await req.json();
  const signature = req.headers.get("x-line-signature");
  const hash = createHmac("sha256", CHANNEL_SECRET)
    .update(JSON.stringify(body))
    .digest("base64");
  if (hash !== signature) {
    return new Response("invalid signature", { status: 401 });
  }

  for (const event of body.events) {
    if (event.type === "message" && event.message.type === "text") {
      const answer = await askLLM(event.message.text); // 呼叫我們的 LLM，通常要 5~20 秒
      await fetch("https://api.line.me/v2/bot/message/reply", {
        method: "POST",
        headers: {
          "Content-Type": "application/json",
          Authorization: `Bearer ${CHANNEL_TOKEN}`,
        },
        body: JSON.stringify({
          replyToken: event.replyToken,
          messages: [{ type: "text", text: answer }],
        }),
      });
    }
  }
  return new Response("ok");
});
```

